  "notes": "Means something is effective, works, or takes effect. The subject is typically the thing that has the effect (medicine, brakes, air conditioning).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- No standard transitive pair\n- Pattern: {効|き}く\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION (IMPORTANT):\n- {効|き}く: to be effective (medicine, brakes, punishment)\n- ⟦{利|き}く→利く：11845_kiku⟧: to work, function, be capable (⟦{融通|ゆうずう}→融通：10914_yuuzuu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{利|き}く→利く：11845_kiku⟧, ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{利|き}く→利く：11845_kiku⟧)\n- ⟦{聞|き}く→聞く：00483_kiku⟧: to listen, hear, ask (completely different meaning)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{効|き}いて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ means \"is in effect\" (resulting state). Example: ⟦{冷房|れいぼう}→冷房：01755_reibou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{効|き}いて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (the AC is on/working).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{薬|くすり}→薬：00793_kusuri⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{効|き}く: medicine works\n- ⟦ブレーキ→ブレーキ：00022_bureeki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{効|き}く: brakes work\n- ⟦{冷房|れいぼう}→冷房：01755_reibou⟧/⟦{暖房|だんぼう}→暖房：01657_danbou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{効|き}く: AC/heating is effective\n- {効|き}いて⟦くる→来る：00254_kuru⟧: to start taking effect (gradual onset)",
